{"id":"2ad9c24714","t":"The Hero Cannot Rest","c":"cv","n":12,"l":12,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-hero-cannot-rest"},"u":1795038349812,"desc":"تمكّن بطلٌ يُدعى راون من قتل ملك الشياطين، لكنه مع ذلك لم يستطع العودة إلى عالمه الأصلي. وهذه قصة بطلٍ يخوض رحلته الثانية، وكل ما يريده هو أن يستريح… لكنه مضطر إلى إنقاذ عالمٍ آخر قبل أن يتمكن أخيرًا من العودة إلى موطنه.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","بطل غير اعتيادي","حرب","خيال","زنزانات","سحر","غموض"],"src":{"ml":"the-hero-cannot-rest"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-hero-cannot-rest|/manga/the-hero-cannot-rest/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-hero-cannot-rest|/manga/the-hero-cannot-rest/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-hero-cannot-rest|/manga/the-hero-cannot-rest/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-hero-cannot-rest|/manga/the-hero-cannot-rest/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-hero-cannot-rest|/manga/the-hero-cannot-rest/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-hero-cannot-rest|/manga/the-hero-cannot-rest/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-hero-cannot-rest|/manga/the-hero-cannot-rest/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-hero-cannot-rest|/manga/the-hero-cannot-rest/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-hero-cannot-rest|/manga/the-hero-cannot-rest/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-hero-cannot-rest|/manga/the-hero-cannot-rest/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-hero-cannot-rest|/manga/the-hero-cannot-rest/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-hero-cannot-rest|/manga/the-hero-cannot-rest/12/"}}}